{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ProCam 是一款功能全面的專業相機應用，專為追求手動控制和高畫質拍攝的用戶而設。無論你是攝影愛好者還是專業人士，它都能提供媲美單反的曝光、對焦、白平衡調校，並支援 4K 影片錄製與多種拍攝模式。目前這款應用正在限時免費，機會難得。</p>\n\n<h2>專業攝影功能</h2>\n<p>ProCam 提供完整的手動控制，包括快門速度、ISO、白平衡與對焦，讓你可以精準掌握每個畫面。影片方面支援 4K Ultra HD 與慢動作錄製，並內建延時攝影功能。此外，應用還具備 60 種濾鏡、17 種鏡頭效果以及非破壞性編輯器，讓後製更加靈活。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-160-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-161-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-162-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-163-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-164-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-165-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ProCam – 專業相機</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T10:40:07.521883+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}